{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113159","id":3044840124,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61fJK8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113159","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113159.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113159.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113159","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113159/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113159/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113159/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c2f8d1a29ba915e2c58941c2ad27c811f3d66489","number":113159,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Android: Fix memory issues in `_variant_to_jvalue()`","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There's some issues in `_variant_to_jvalue()` which mostly stem from `jvalue` being a `union` (so, all the fields are stored on an overlapping chunk of memory) and the code seems to be treating it sort of like it's a `struct` (or at least like it's 32-bits rather than 64-bits?).\r\n\r\nFor example, the `jvalue value` isn't initialized to anything, so it starts out with junk memory, but the default case is to set `value.i = 0`, which will only set the lower 32-bits and leave the upper 32-bits with junk in them:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9dd6c4dbac70b28e8156255c3a2b78722772b036/platform/android/jni_utils.cpp#L273-L275\r\n\r\nAlso, the function may set other fields like `value.z`, `value.j` or `value.f` (when `force_object` is `false`), but at the end, it will overwrite anything that's there by setting `value.l`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9dd6c4dbac70b28e8156255c3a2b78722772b036/platform/android/jni_utils.cpp#L277\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes all that by:\r\n\r\n- Initializing the `jvalue value` to zero (which also means we don't need a default case or some of the `else` branches, we can just leave it as-is)\r\n- Keeping track of if the value is an object or not, and only if it is will it set `value.l` at the end\r\n\r\nSome aspects of the bugs addressed here are a regression caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107075 (which I discovered after rebasing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111732), but some are pre-existing problems.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-25T19:45:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T10:03:41Z","closed_at":"2025-11-27T09:01:47Z","merged_at":"2025-11-27T09:01:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"b22d15311